Package: app-encloser
Version: 1.0.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, bubblewrap
Maintainer: Local Developer <sr@localhost>
Description: Native Isolated Package & Application Manager with Bubblewrap Sandbox, GTK4/Libadwaita UI, and MCP Server
 App Encloser encloses any Linux application package (.deb, .AppImage, .tar.gz,
 .zip, .rpm, .snap, .jar, etc.) into a 100% self-contained directory inside
 ~/EnclosedApps/<AppName>/ with optional strict Bubblewrap filesystem sandboxing,
 threat and telemetry tracker scanning, and built-in JSON-RPC 2.0 MCP server.
